WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.109
Have you ever wondered what SCP-2599, Not
Good Enough, wants more than anything?

00:00:05.109 --> 00:00:11.251
Foundation staff snapped a picture of SCP-2599
with SCP-978, the Desire Camera, while it

00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:14.300
was attempting to solve a 100-piece jigsaw
puzzle.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.360
This was the result:

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:19.349
"SCP-2599 is being praised by a researcher.

00:00:19.349 --> 00:00:21.289
Photo did not fully develop."

00:00:21.289 --> 00:00:27.179
It seems that SCP-2599 just wants her work
to be recognized, to be told that finally,

00:00:27.179 --> 00:00:28.880
she did a good job.

